    {
      "id": "t_right",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 670,
      "y": 112,
      "width": 480,
      "height": 196,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e293b",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "roundness": null,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1753574400000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "KRAFT SELF-MANAGED QUORUM (KIP-500)\n\n\u2022 Controller nodes are Raft voters\n\u2022 Standby controllers are Raft followers,\n  already replaying the metadata log \u2014\n  no reload needed when a vote happens\n\u2022 Brokers tail a log of deltas instead of\n  receiving full-state RPC fan-out on\n  every metadata change\n\nFAILOVER: UNDER 1 SECOND, typically",
      "fontSize": 13.5,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "KRAFT SELF-MANAGED QUORUM (KIP-500)\n\n\u2022 Controller nodes are Raft voters\n\u2022 Standby controllers are Raft followers,\n  already replaying the metadata log \u2014\n  no reload needed when a vote happens\n\u2022 Brokers tail a log of deltas instead of\n  receiving full-state RPC fan-out on\n  every metadata change\n\nFAILOVER: UNDER 1 SECOND, typically",
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
